  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5805.05 Scope of Hearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5805.05 Scope of Hearing. The scope of the hearing shall be limited to:\n\n(a) A determination as to whether the vehicle passed or failed the opacity test.\n\n(b) A determination as to the correctness of the performance of the test procedure.\n\n(c) Other mitigating factors that may be relevant to the finding that there was a violation.\n\nSource. #6887, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-99",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5800.html"
}
